# w1 — the deck (mirrors demos/11-noita/w1-cast-block.bqn, main wand)
# Wand [Double, SB, SB, SB, DP, SB]: rows 1-6 in slot order; drawAdd is the card's draw count (multicast 2/3, modifier 1, projectile 0).
n 7
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4 5 6
col wand bool 1 0 0 0 0 0 0
col spell bool 0 1 1 1 1 1 1
col slot num -1 0 1 2 3 4 5
col proj bool 0 0 1 1 1 0 1
col mod bool 0 0 0 0 0 1 0
col multi bool 0 1 0 0 0 0 0
col drawAdd num 0 2 0 0 0 1 0
col bal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col minBal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col member bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
bind deck mask 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
ja 杖 wand
ja 呪文 spell
ja 枠 slot
ja 投射 proj
ja 改 mod
ja 抜追加 drawAdd
ja 残高 bal
ja 最低残高 minBal
ja 成員 member
ja 山札 deck
